sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as MirageAPI
    participant ORCH as Orchestrator
    participant G as Ghost
    participant S as Seed
    participant RM as ReadModels

    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/intents
    API->>ORCH: submit issue intent
    ORCH-->>API: accepted intent id
    API-->>FE: 202 accepted

    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/intents/{intent_id}/reconcile
    API->>ORCH: reconcile intent
    ORCH->>G: command envelope
    G->>S: seed.execute
    S-->>G: seed.result
    G-->>ORCH: event envelope
    ORCH-->>G: event.ack
    ORCH->>RM: update report and metrics
    RM-->>API: report snapshot
    API-->>FE: 200 report response
